# scripts/opcount: `readerbench bench record N` reads a record's JSON N
# times on the prelude's Reader interface (PORT-WIRE-READERS R1): the
# interface decoder, which the IR builds. The control is hand Go:
# encoding/json into the record's struct.
unit read
sizes 20000 120000
args bench record {n}
control benchmarks/wirereaders/testdata/control
